#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "I put the flowers by the window. Yellow flowers always make the kitchen feel like summer. The cat has already tried to eat one."
msgstr "我把花放在窗邊。黃色的花總讓廚房充滿夏天的感覺。貓咪已經想吃掉一朵了。"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Keep these words"
msgstr "保留這段話"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Keep this with the family?"
msgstr "把這段話留給家人嗎？"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Kept memories"
msgstr "已保留的回憶"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Kept with the family. You can find it under Kept memories."
msgstr "已保留給家人。你可以在「已保留的回憶」中找到。"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Leave this one"
msgstr "這段不保留"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Left out of memories. The original conversation is unchanged."
msgstr "這段話未加入回憶，原本的對話不會改變。"

#: app/memory-review-preview.tsx
msgid "Memory review preview"
msgstr "回憶確認流程預覽"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Mia asked: How did you meet Grandpa?"
msgstr "Mia 問：你是怎麼認識爺爺的？"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Mia asked: What made you smile this morning?"
msgstr "Mia 問：今天早上，有什麼事讓你笑了？"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Mom"
msgstr "媽媽"

#: app/memory-review-preview.tsx
msgid "Mom’s memories"
msgstr "媽媽的回憶"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Nothing waiting to review. New suggestions will appear here."
msgstr "目前沒有待確認的內容。新的建議會出現在這裡。"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Only these words will stay in family memories after the conversation’s 30 days. Everyone in your Vela family can read them. You can remove this memory later."
msgstr "對話的30天保存期限過後，只有這段話會留在家庭回憶中。Vela 家庭中的每位成員都可以閱讀。你之後隨時可以移除這則回憶。"

#: app/memory-review-preview.tsx
msgid "Opening the preview…"
msgstr "正在開啟預覽……"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Opening your memories…"
msgstr "正在開啟你的回憶……"

#: app/memory-review-preview.tsx
msgid "Preview controls"
msgstr "預覽設定"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Read the conversation"
msgstr "閱讀原本的對話"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Remove from memories"
msgstr "從回憶中移除"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Remove this memory"
msgstr "移除這則回憶"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Remove this memory?"
msgstr "要移除這則回憶嗎？"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Removed from family memories."
msgstr "已從家庭回憶中移除。"

#: app/memory-review-preview.tsx
msgid "Reset the examples"
msgstr "重設範例"

