msgid "Simulate a changed source"
msgstr "模擬原始內容變更"

#: app/memory-review-preview.tsx
msgid "Simulate a failed change"
msgstr "模擬操作失敗"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Someone who matters"
msgstr "重要的人"

#: app/memory-review-preview.tsx
msgid "Something Mom loves"
msgstr "媽媽喜歡的事物"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Something that made you laugh"
msgstr "讓你開懷的趣事"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Something to come back to"
msgstr "之後想再聊的事"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Something you love"
msgstr "你喜歡的事物"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "That change could not be confirmed. Try the action again."
msgstr "無法確認這次操作的結果。請再試一次。"

#: app/memory-review-preview.tsx
msgid "The next action will fail once, so you can try recovery."
msgstr "下一次操作會失敗一次，讓你試試重試流程。"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "The source changed or is no longer available. Nothing new was kept."
msgstr "原始內容已變更或無法取得，沒有保留新的回憶。"

#: app/memory-review-preview.tsx
msgid "The source will become unavailable on the next action."
msgstr "下一次操作時，原始內容將無法取得。"

#: app/memory-review-preview.tsx
msgid "The things Mom loves, and the stories the family keeps. Mom decides what stays."
msgstr "媽媽喜歡的事物，以及家人保留的故事。哪些內容留下來，由媽媽決定。"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "The things you love. The stories you tell. You decide what stays with the family."
msgstr "你喜歡的事物，你分享的故事。要為家人留下什麼，由你決定。"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "These words will leave the family’s saved memories. Removing a memory does not delete copies someone has already downloaded."
msgstr "這段話將從家人保存的回憶中移除，但不會刪除其他人已下載的副本。"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "To review"
msgstr "待確認"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Try again"
msgstr "再試一次"

#: app/memory-review-preview.tsx
msgid "View as a family member"
msgstr "以家人身分查看"

#: app/memory-review-preview.tsx
msgid "View as the author"
msgstr "以本人身分查看"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Yellow flowers always make the kitchen feel like summer."
msgstr "黃色的花總讓廚房充滿夏天的感覺。"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Yes, keep these words"
msgstr "好，保留這段話"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "You"
msgstr "你"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Your grandfather asked me to dance, and stepped on my shoe before the music even started."
msgstr "你爺爺邀我跳舞，音樂還沒開始，就先踩到我的鞋子了。"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Your grandfather asked me to dance, and stepped on my shoe before the music even started. I laughed so much that he asked for a second chance."
msgstr "你爺爺邀我跳舞，音樂還沒開始，就先踩到我的鞋子了。我笑個不停，他就拜託我再給他一次機會。"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Your kept memories will be here. Start with a story, a joke, or something you love."
msgstr "你保留的回憶會出現在這裡。可以從一則故事、一個笑話，或喜歡的事物開始。"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Your memories"
msgstr "你的回憶"

#: src/data/memory-review-demo.ts
msgid "Your memories could not be reached. Try opening them again."
msgstr "暫時無法取得你的回憶，請再開啟一次。"
